# devlog/ is tracked. This overrides a machine-local "devlog/" in .git/info/exclude or a global
# gitignore, which would make git add, lint-staged and vp fmt skip it. Patterns that match paths
# inside it, such as "devlog/*", still apply.
!/devlog/
